The Internet Is Cooked. We're On Air.

The Problem

News consumption is everywhere, but most platforms deliver information without making it entertaining or engaging. India's internet culture is full of celebrity controversies, influencer drama, reality-show chaos and viral moments that audiences love discussing.

Our Solution

NAMMA MACHA FM 98.6 is an AI-powered entertainment radio station that transforms trending Indian news and internet stories into short, hilarious, Bengaluru-style radio broadcasts.

Meet Namma Macha — our fictional AI radio jockey with an unhinged personality, dark humour, savage sarcasm and authentic local flavour.

How It Works

1. Curated news stories are collected with their original sources.
2. Google Gemini analyses the context and generates witty, story-specific commentary while preserving factual accuracy.
3. Gnani AI's Timbre converts the generated scripts into expressive spoken broadcasts.
4. Users can listen, replay and share their favourite broadcasts.

Technology Stack

- Google Gemini API — AI script generation.
- Gnani AI Timbre — text-to-speech.
- Next.js, TypeScript and Tailwind CSS — web application.

What Makes It Different?

We aren't building another news aggregator or generic AI voice assistant. We're combining AI, regional humour and internet culture to create an entertainment-first audio experience with a distinct Bengaluru identity.

Our Vision

To make news and internet culture more engaging, shareable and entertaining through a uniquely Indian radio personality.

